</surname><given-names>KA</given-names></name><name><surname>Plevritis</surname><given-names>SK</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Effect of screening and adjuvant therapy on mortality from breast cancer</article-title><source>N Engl J Med</source><year>2005</year><volume>353</volume><fpage>1784</fpage><lpage>92</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16251534</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b3-co13_1p008"><label>3</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>King</surname><given-names>CR</given-names></name><name><surname>Kraus</surname><given-names>MH</given-names></name><name><surname>Aaronson</surname><given-names>SA</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Amplification of a novel v-<italic>erbB</italic>-related gene in a human mammary carcinoma</article-title><source>Science</source><year>1985</year><volume>229</volume><fpage>974</fpage><lpage>6</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2992089</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b4-co13_1p008"><label>4</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Slamon</surname><given-names>DJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Clark</surname><given-names>GM</given-names></name><name><surname>Wong</surname><given-names>SG</given-names></name><name><surname>Levin</surname><given-names>WJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Ullrich</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>McGuire</surname><given-names>WL</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Human breast cancer: correlation of relapse and survival with amplification of the <italic>HER-2</italic>/<italic>neu</italic> oncogene</article-title><source>Science</source><year>1987</year><volume>235</volume><fpage>177</fpage><lpage>82</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3798106</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b5-co13_1p008"><label>5</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Stern</surname><given-names>DF</given-names></name><name><surname>Heffernan</surname><give